{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14203","headline":"九日贾明府见访 · 戎昱","name":"九日贾明府见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独掩衡门秋景闲，洛阳才子访柴关。\n莫嫌浊酒君须醉，虽是贫家菊也斑。\n同人愿得长携手，久客深思一破颜。\n却笑孟嘉吹帽落，登高何必上龙山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}